{{> studentTop}}
<div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">EXPLORE WHAT COMES NEXT</p><h1>Career pathways</h1><p class="muted">Connect your learning evidence to possible tourism career directions.</p></div></div>
<div class="notice info">These are exploratory learning recommendations using transparent starter rules. They are not job offers or employment probabilities. Unlocked and ongoing courses are not counted as earned knowledge. Faculty should validate pathway requirements.</div>
<div class="grid cols-2">{{#each tracks}}<article class="card"><div class="row wrap"><span class="chip">{{label}}</span>{{#if preferred}}<span class="chip rose">Related to your interest</span>{{/if}}</div><h2 class="space-top">{{title}}</h2><p class="small muted">{{explanation}}</p><h3>Supporting knowledge areas</h3><ul class="list-clean small">{{#each strengths}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{else}}<li class="muted">Not enough supporting evidence yet.</li>{{/each}}</ul><h3 class="space-top">Areas to develop or assess</h3><ul class="list-clean small">{{#each gaps}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{else}}<li>Seek practical application and faculty feedback.</li>{{/each}}</ul><p class="small muted space-top">Check role-specific training, qualifications and employer requirements separately.</p></article>{{/each}}</div>
<section class="card space-top"><div class="row wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">OPTIONAL GEMINI ASSISTANCE</p><h2>Explain my learning plan</h2></div><span class="chip gray">{{#if aiReady}}AI available{{else}}Configuration needed{{/if}}</span></div><p class="small muted">Gemini can explain the existing knowledge evidence and suggest learning next steps. It does not change your grades or pathway ranking.</p>{{#if aiReady}}<form action="/student/careers/generate" method="post" data-ai-form><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="{{csrf}}"><label class="answer"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" value="yes" required><span>I agree to send my competency scores and pathway labels to Gemini. My name, email, Student ID and profile text are excluded.</span></label><button class="button space-top">Generate AI guidance →</button></form>{{else}}<p class="small muted">The system owner must configure GEMINI_API_KEY and GEMINI_MODEL. Your rule-based pathways remain available.</p>{{/if}}{{#if ai}}<div class="divider"></div><span class="chip">AI-generated guidance · {{ai.generatedAt}}</span><p class="space-top">{{ai.summary}}</p><ul class="list-clean">{{#each ai.nextSteps}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{/each}}</ul><p class="small muted">AI can make mistakes. Confirm advice with your faculty adviser.</p>{{/if}}</section>
<div class="section-heading"><h2>Courses for your next steps</h2><a href="/student/courses">View all →</a></div><div class="grid cols-3">{{#each recommendations}}<article class="card"><span class="chip">{{domain}}</span><h3 class="space-top">{{title}}</h3><p class="small muted">{{description}}</p><a class="button secondary" href="/student/courses/{{id}}">Explore course →</a></article>{{else}}<div class="card"><p class="muted">Explore the catalog to reinforce your knowledge and ask faculty about practical learning opportunities.</p></div>{{/each}}</div>
{{> studentBottom}}
